  Background: {fileID: 0}
  narrativeText: "Hearing is the last sense to remain when a person dies. Through
    the haze, you can faintly hear your \u2018neighbors\u2019 rushing over after
    discovering what has happened here, their despair beast-like wails. The nobility
    of your sacrifice does not lessen the pain of your body being burned, but I respect
    your determination to die as a human being."
